{"id":1030102,"chapter_id":1030102,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"安心して、あたしに任せてもらえばしくじることなんてあり得ないわ。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"もう、しくじらないって。安心して……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"ははははははは、うっ。可愛いわね局長……あたし大丈夫だから……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"ゲェーッ————","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"大丈夫とは……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"……もう一回トイレ……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"行動部門のメンバーが小さい公衆トイレに目を向けている。あまりに気まずい雰囲気だ。","style":3,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"作戦メンバー","content":"本当に大丈夫ですか、局長？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"この状況はさすがに「大丈夫」とは言いづらいな。","style":2,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"行動部門全員、数十名が小さな公衆トイレの前に集まっている。","style":3,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"澈は無意識に口角をヒクヒクとさせ、K.K.は額に血管を浮き上がらせている。他のメンバーは気まずさでだんまりを決め込んでいる。","style":3,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"options":["さて、どうする？"],"style":6,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102012,"trial_step":12,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"さて、どうする？","goto":13}]},{"step":13,"speaker":"澈","content":"このままじゃ日が暮れるぞ。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"あの……もうあたしのことはいいから、先に行って……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"すぐ追いつくから……ゲェーッ……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"トイレの中からハクイツの声が聞こえる。","style":3,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"局長、まずは偵察要員を潜入させてはどうでしょうか。敵情報を把握して、その後に主力を出しましょう。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"作戦メンバー","content":"ハクイツですが、あれだけのコンビクトは重要な戦力ですし……偵察の時間、彼女を休ませるのもいいかと。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"作戦メンバー","content":"後で奴らを捕まえる時に彼女が回復していれば、作戦の成功率も上がります。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"各員もその考えに賛同して頷く。","style":3,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"content":"だが、MBCCの行動部門のメンバーとシンジケートの相性はあまりにも悪い。彼らが潜入に向いているとは到底思えない。","style":3,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"content":"それよりも、適任者が目の前にいる。","style":3,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"K.K.、澈。私と一緒に潜入してくれ。他のメンバーはここで待機だ。","style":2,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"作戦メンバー","content":"分かりました。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"content":"あなたたち三人はかつてシンジケート一番の繁華街、██街を通り過ぎた。長年手入れがされていないため、ここの建物はかなり色褪せている。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"content":"周囲に人は少ない。若い者は更に少なく、大体は年寄り連中だ。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"content":"この退廃的な光景にあなたに眉を顰めた。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"気にしないでくれ。ハクイツはいつもああなんだ。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"長く付き合えば慣れる。とにかく彼女にあまり期待しすぎないように……ただ、全く期待できないこともないけどな。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"content":"……","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"澈","content":"邪魔して悪いが、局長は別に社長のことを考えてないみたいだぜ。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"speaker":"澈","content":"それより、お前こそ睨まれてるぞ。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"content":"澈の視線の方向を見ると、涼んでいた婆さんが今首を伸ばしてあなたたち三人を睨んでいるのが見えた。K.K.は視線を逸らして顔を見せないようにする。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"content":"この一連の動作は逆効果を生んだ。婆さんはあなたたちの身分を確認したようで、満面の笑みを浮かべて近づいてきた。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"speaker":"婆さん","content":"K.K.じゃないか？ようやく帰ってきたのかい？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"speaker":"婆さん","content":"まったく、前と同じように声も掛けないで遠出をして、心配ばかり掛けさせちゃって。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"……大丈夫だから。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"speaker":"婆さん","content":"そりゃそうだ、あなたほど逞しい子はいないさ。でもあなたがいない間、こっちには色々あったんだよ。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"なにがあったんだ？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"speaker":"婆さん","content":"サトーさんの家の下水道が一ヶ月詰まったままで、皆お手上げなんだ。あなたを頼りにしてるよ。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"……私……えっと……今日は忙しくて……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"speaker":"婆さん","content":"じゃ明日行ってやってよ。私が仕事を紹介したの、忘れないでよ。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"speaker":"婆さん","content":"そういえば、この方は？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"content":"婆さんが値踏みをするようにあなたに視線を向ける。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"speaker":"婆さん","content":"ほう、これはこれは役人様じゃないか。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"？","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"content":"私が役人に見えるのか？","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"speaker":"婆さん","content":"婆さんの前で嘘をつくのかい？あなたが何者かなんてお見通しよ？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"婆さん","content":"まあそれもいいわね。はやくあのボスと手を切れって前から言ってたんだから。何事もあなたに丸投げで本当にしょうもない奴なんだから。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"speaker":"婆さん","content":"この金髪のガキもだよ。毎日何処に行ってるのか分からないし、仕事頼もうとしたらすぐ逃げる。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"content":"澈も婆さんの説教を無視して、空を見ながら口笛を吹く。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"婆さん","content":"最近そのボスがなんかの会社を始めて、マフィアと縄張り争いしてたって聞いたけど。ちっ、金持ちぶりやがって。ウチの店から借金もしてたくせに。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"speaker":"婆さん","content":"やっぱり役人とつるむのが一番安定だね。私も鼻が高いよ。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"content":"コホン……","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"その……まだ用事があるから、お先に。それじゃ。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"婆さん","content":"はいよ、じゃ私もこれで。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"speaker":"婆さん","content":"下水道の件、忘れないでよ。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"……そのうち行く。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"婆さんを振り切って、角を二つ曲がった先、古びた建物が目の前に現れた。ここが「白記事務所」本部、今回の目的地だ。","style":3,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"content":"シンジケートの大多数のマフィアが解体された今、ビルの入り口前に立つ厳つい門番が格段に目立つ。","style":3,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"あいつらがいる限り、簡単には入れないな。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"content":"だが場所は特定できたし、待機中の隊員に指示すれば強行突入できる。","style":2,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"下手に刺激しないほうがいい。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"content":"そうだな。門番共をどうにかできないか。","style":2,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"speaker":"澈","content":"難しく考えるなって。俺に任せろ。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"content":"なにをするつもりだ？勝算があるのか？","style":2,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"speaker":"澈","content":"安心しろ——俺はハクイツとは違う。","voice"